0..74 Comment "// Two versions of a store\'s signature, and the flow from the newer to the"
75..84 Comment "// older."
85..87 Comment "//"
88..159 Comment "// The older store reads by `get`, and the newer one by `fetch`. A role"
160..234 Comment "// written against the older version can run at a site whose module models"
235..309 Comment "// the newer one. The site reads its module through a translation, and the"
310..332 Comment "// manifold admits it."
333..335 Comment "//"
336..411 Comment "// The flow `downgrade` reads the newer store as the older one. Each of its"
412..489 Comment "// members renames one member, so it is a path: no code runs at the boundary."
490..557 Comment "// Its body reads the domain\'s sorts and operations by their names."
558..560 Comment "//"
561..608 Comment "// - see: `translated.gandr` — the older role"
609..682 Comment "// - see: `translated.site.gandr` — a site reading its module through a"
683..716 Comment "//   renaming and via `downgrade`"
